e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">random</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> totalDegree;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> newNode; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> degrees[i];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">targets.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          targets.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          break</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> target</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> targets) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      graph.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(newNode)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(target);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      graph.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(target)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(newNode);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      degrees[newNode]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      degrees[target]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>优先连接的本质是正反馈循环：高度节点吸引更多连接 → 度进一步增高 → 吸引力更强。在软件生态系统中，这种正反馈随处可见：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>领域</th>\n<th>Hub 节点</th>\n<th>优先连接机制</th>\n<th>马太效应表现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>npm 生态</td>\n<td>lodash、express</td>\n<td>文档完善 → 更多用户 → 更多贡献</td>\n<td>下载量差距指数扩大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GitHub</td>\n<td>热门项目</td>\n<td>Star 多 → 更多曝光 → 更多 Star</td>\n<td>1% 项目获 90% 关注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术栈</td>\n<td>React、Python</td>\n<td>社区大 → 更多资源 → 更多采用</td>\n<td>生态壁垒持续强化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微服务</td>\n<td>认证服务、用户服务</td>\n<td>基础功能 → 更多依赖者 → 更核心</td>\n<td>关键度持续增长</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"鲁棒性与脆弱性的双面性\">鲁棒性与脆弱性的双面性</h2><p>无标度网络展现出一个独特的双面特性：对随机故障高度鲁棒，但对针对 Hub 节点的定向攻击极度脆弱。</p>\n<p>随机故障鲁棒性：由于绝大多数节点度很低，随机移除节点大概率移除的是低度节点。移除这些节点对网络的连通性影响很小。在互联网中，普通路由器宕机几乎不影响全局连通性。</p>\n<p>定向攻击脆弱性：如果有意移除少数 Hub 节点，网络可能迅速分裂为不连通的碎片。仅移除 5-10% 的最高度节点就可能导致无标度网络完全断裂。在微服务架构中，如果认证服务（高度 Hub）宕机，可能导致所有依赖认证的服务同时失效。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  subgraph 随机故障&#10;    A[移除低度节点] --&gt; B[网络基本完整]&#10;    B --&gt; C[连通性保持]&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph 定向攻击&#10;    D[移除 Hub 节点] --&gt; E[网络碎片化]&#10;    E --&gt; F[连通性丧失]&#10;  end\">graph TD\n  subgraph 随机故障\n    A[移除低度节点] --&gt; B[网络基本完整]\n    B --&gt; C[连通性保持]\n  end\n  subgraph 定向攻击\n    D[移除 Hub 节点] --&gt; E[网络碎片化]\n    E --&gt; F[连通性丧失]\n  end</pre><p>这种双面特性对软件系统设计的启示：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>利用鲁棒性</th>\n<th>防御脆弱性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>架构设计</td>\n<td>允许非关键服务容错</td>\n<td>关键 Hub 服务多副本 + 异地容灾</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监控策略</td>\n<td>低度服务可降低监控粒度</td>\n<td>Hub 服务需要最精细的监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>故障恢复</td>\n<td>低度服务可延迟恢复</td>\n<td>Hub 服务需要最高优先级恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全防护</td>\n<td>普通节点标准防护</td>\n<td>Hub 节点最高级别安全</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"幂律分布的识别与验证\">幂律分布的识别与验证</h2><p>在实际系统中识别幂律分布需要严谨的统计方法。仅凭对数-对数坐标下的直线不足以确认幂律——许多其他分布（指数截断幂律、对数正态分布）在对数-对数图上也近似直线。</p>\n<p>Aaron Clauset 等人在 2009 年提出了幂律分布的标准验证流程：使用最大似然估计（MLE）拟合幂律参数，然后使用 Kolmogorov-Smirnov 检验和 likelihood ratio test 来判断数据是否显著偏好幂律分布。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface PowerLawFit {&#10;  alpha: number;&#10;  xmin: number;&#10;  ksStat: number;&#10;  pValue: number;&#10;  isSignificant: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const estimatePowerLaw = (degrees: number[]): { alpha: number; xmin: number } =&gt; {&#10;  const sorted = [...degrees].sort((a, b) =&gt; b - a);&#10;  const xmin = Math.max(1, sorted[Math.floor(sorted.length * 0.9)]);&#10;&#10;  const filtered = sorted.filter((d) =&gt; d &gt;= xmin);&#10;  const n = filtered.length;&#10;&#10;  const alpha = 1 + n / filtered.reduce((sum, x) =&gt; sum + Math.log(x / (xmin - 0.5)), 0);&#10;&#10;  return { alpha, xmin };&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PowerLawFit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  xmin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  ksStat</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  pValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  isSignificant</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> estimatePowerLaw<